<title>USA: Southern Co seven month net rises.</title>
<headline>Southern Co seven month net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven month period ended July.</p>
<p>					     1996	  1995  Pct. Chg.</p>
<p> Operating revenues (in millions)   $ 6,004    $ 5,062   18.6</p>
<p>Consolidated net income</p>
<p>  (in millions)				 701	  648    8.2</p>
<p>Average number of shares of common</p>
<p>  stock outstanding (in millions)	 671	  664    1.1</p>
<p>Earnings per share of common</p>
<p>  stock					  1.04	 0.98    6.1</p>
<p> Kilowatt-Hour Sales:		    (millions of KWH)</p>
<p>   Total Sales			     89,777     83,939    7.0</p>
<p>   Total Retail Sales		    77,455     73,265    5.7</p>
<p>Twelve Months Ended July	     1996	  1995  Pct. Chg.</p>
<p> Operating Revenues (in millions)   $10,122    $ 8,546   18.4</p>
<p>Consolidated Net Income</p>
<p>  (in millions)			     1,156	1,086    6.4</p>
<p>Average Number of Shares of Common</p>
<p>  Stock Outstanding (in millions)	 669	  659    1.5</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share of Common Stock    1.73	 1.65    4.8</p>
<p> Kilowatt-Hour Sales:			     (millions of KWH)</p>
<p>   Total Sales			    152,046    142,675    6.6</p>
<p>   Total Retail Sales		   131,783    124,419    5.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Results include acquisition of United Kingdom's South Western Electricity that was completed in October 1995. Data for prior periods does not reflect this acquisition.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
